{"title": "Child of the Moonmaiden", "pageid": 31597, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Child_of_the_Moonmaiden", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Child of the Moonmaiden</b> is a passive feature available to <a href=\"/wiki/Dame_Aylin\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dame Aylin\">Dame Aylin</a>, that prevents her from being permanently killed.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Blessed with the favour of a goddess, Nightsong cannot be permanently killed. When unconscious, the start of her turn she recovers 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit point</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201334\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 445/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1557/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 949/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643690/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   23.251      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   23.251      1 -total\n 39.65%    9.218      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 17.79%    4.137      1 Template:PageSeo\n 16.69%    3.880      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 16.49%    3.834      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.83%    2.750   